R-CH10 R-TF8 (slice 238, Design Q613 item 4): `tln tool update talon` does not check that the tables of config.toml and talon.toml are equal. config.toml and the talon.toml of the directory of the run have the table reify with another source: the update goes on, exit 0. The case is gate/tf10-update-talon with these two files. The command reads no talon.toml today, so the case is green and guards that this stays so.
